# sgo.build — the phone spike's Sgola side (plan 0023 M1).
#
# APP mode plus `emitpackage`: alongside the ordinary package-main binary,
# the whole-program emission (sgola runtime included) is ALSO produced as an
# importable Go package in the sibling dir .sgo/watacore-pkg — that package
# is what gomobile binds. Its `func main` is the exported `RunCLI()`, which
# the spike never calls.
mode app
emitname watacore
emitpackage watacore
binname watabind
gomod github.com/adriaanm/wata/tools/phone-spike/watacore
